---
title: Diagram lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft : Create with AI
  [*] --> Saved : New diagram or import
  Draft --> Saved : first Save
  Draft --> [*] : discarded, or purged after 24 hours
  Saved --> Saved : Save (new version)
  Saved --> Deleted : Delete
  Deleted --> Saved : admin restores within 30 days
  Deleted --> [*] : purged after 30 days
  state Saved {
    [*] --> NotSubmitted
    NotSubmitted --> InReview : submit to GitHub
    InReview --> Approved : pull request merged
    InReview --> Rejected : pull request closed
    InReview --> NotSubmitted : withdrawn
    Approved --> InReview : resubmit
    Rejected --> InReview : resubmit
  }
